# NutriForge AI - Frontend Environment Configuration Example
# In production, set this to your hosted backend URL (e.g., https://nutriforge-backend.onrender.com)
# When unset in production builds, defaults to relative root ("") for same-domain proxy setups.
# In local development, defaults to http://localhost:8000 when unset.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
